[h2]Build 0.9.123[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]The industrial repair center now waits for its output, like Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory's machines.[/b] If the orange output spot or both red reject chutes are blocked, it holds what it has and pauses - for as long as it takes - instead of dropping everything on the ground next to itself after a couple of minutes. Its inspect pane says what it is waiting for.
[*]Recycled materials still leave by the red reject chutes, one stack per chute. Put a conveyor or a shelf on a chute and a recycle that breaks into several materials gets out without pausing.
[*]Nothing it holds is ever lost: uninstalling or deconstructing it puts everything inside on the floor.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
